        "teacherMoves": "Say: 'Our model must show what we now know and what is still unknown. What belongs on the poster?' Give WAIT TIME of 12 seconds. Cold-call 3 learners to explain one label and why it is correct, and ask 2 others: 'What would you change?' Prompt: 'Where on this diagram would the bucket go? What do we need to find out?' Check that labels use perpendicular height and units. Ask learners to share one place where they could use the pyramid rule in Kenya (maize stores in the Rift Valley, roof designs, heaps of tea leaves or sand).",
